        // The grass bridge, across the last corner: slow without a boost, quicker with one. Issue
        // #156: narrow (5 m), from the right of the road: a gentle bend off the rim, 30° to the
        // right, straight, then a long bend onto the start straight's shoulder (a narrow path's
        // curves must be taken at speed); closed by a panel 26 m in, where it is clear of the
        // road's edge (a big sign board, a little askew, facing the karts that come along the rim:
        // the way behind it goes straight away from them). It breaks only under a kart with a
        // boost (the mini-turbo of the bulge's last turn, a piment); without one, the kart bounces
