    // Issue #144 (GD « Conception des circuits », step 2): the obstacles. On one side of the
    // road each, the other side free (the bots keep to it), never on a shortcut's mouth, a jump's
    // landing nor a tight corner's apex. A stone swinging over the right side of the start
    // straight, from a gallows beyond its wall (the bots keep left for the hairpin anyway); a log
    // rolling across the left side of the rim, before the long left turn (the bots are on its
    // outside, on the right); a trunk fallen on the start straight's shoulder; boulders and a
